{"seq":39,"at":"2026-10-22","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2436"},"reason":"Out of date: in July 2026 the International Booker was renamed the Bukhman International Booker Prize, and from 2027 the fund doubles to £100,000, still split equally between author and translator. Body and notes say so 'as of 2026'.","by":"handcheck-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.irishtimes.com/culture/books/2026/07/03/international-booker-prize-fund-doubles/"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Booker_Prize"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",530],["-","£50,000"],["+","prize"],["=",1],["+","money – £50,000, doubled to £100,000 from the 2027 prize after the award was renamed the Bukhman International Booker Prize in 2026 – "],["=",271]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",466],["-","die"],["+","das"],["=",1],["+","Preisgeld – "],["=",2],["-","Pfund"],["+","Pfund,"],["=",1],["-","werden"],["+","ab"],["=",1],["+","dem Preis von 2027 verdoppelt auf 100.000 Pfund, nachdem die Auszeichnung 2026 in Bukhman International Booker Prize umbenannt wurde – wird "],["=",251]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",496],["+","призовые — "],["=",4],["-","фунтов"],["+","фунтов,"],["=",1],["+","с премии 2027 года удвоенные до 100 000 после того, как в 2026 году её переименовали в Bukhman International Booker Prize, — "],["=",247]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"“Britain” or “Great Britain” also counts.","new":"“Britain” or “Great Britain” also counts. As of 2026: the prize was renamed the Bukhman International Booker Prize in July 2026; from 2027 the winner's £100,000 is shared equally by author and translator(s)."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"„Vereinigtes Königreich“ gilt ebenso.","new":"„Vereinigtes Königreich“ gilt ebenso. Stand 2026: Der Preis wurde im Juli 2026 in Bukhman International Booker Prize umbenannt; ab 2027 teilen sich Autor und Übersetzer die 100.000 Pfund zu gleichen Teilen."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"Ответ «Соединённое Королевство» тоже засчитывает